<p> 5   Mayne Nickless	 169.76   7.69</p>
<p> 6   Colonial Coml	  122.95   2.25</p>
<p> 7   Adel Bton Cement     119.57   1.65</p>
<p> 8   ST.Barbara Mine	116.90   0.83</p>
<p> 9   Herald Rsc		91.15   1.03</p>
<p>10   Westral Forest	  72.46   2.00</p>
<p>Lowest 10</p>
